  m_Name: Bakunawa
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HalimawEntry
  monsterName: Bakunawa
  lore: The Bakunawa is an ancient sea serpent of immense size, believed to dwell
    beneath the deepest oceans. According to legend, it once attempted to devour
    the seven moons, causing darkness to cover the world. Villagers beat drums, rang
    bells, and made loud noises to frighten the great serpent into releasing the
    moon. It is considered one of the most powerful beings in Filipino mythology
  weakness: Holy relics blessed by ancient shamans
